TITLE:: CloudPanel
summary:: Cloud's device panel
categories:: Libraries>Cloud
related:: Classes/Cloud, Classes/CloudView, Classes/FxDevicePanel

DESCRIPTION::
The link::Classes/FxDevicePanel:: every effect of the family has, plus one thing: it hands the display the panel, so hovering a part of the link::Classes/CloudView:: lights the knobs that set it, and hovering one of those knobs lights its part of the display. code::Cloud.panelClass:: answers it, so code::c.gui:: and code::c.panel(view):: both use it.

code::
c = Cloud.new;
c.gui;                                   // the window, with a CloudPanel in it

(
// or the same panel in a window of yours
w = Window("cloud", Rect(100, 100, 950, 600));
p = c.panel(w.view);
w.view.layout = VLayout(p.view);
p.running = true;                        // meters on while it shows
w.onClose = { p.remove };
w.front;
);
::

